1400: [I] Jan  1 03:03:55 ndm: Core::System::StartupConfig: saving (http/rci).

(Consecutive lab-tz-begin / lab-tz-skipped / lab-tz-end lines: the optional TZ
RCI GET is omitted for mipsel, no busybox wget timeout SIGSEGV — the proven
TZ-safe baseline.  The probe was seeded afterwards over SSH, with NO manual
start; the scenario's pre-reboot negative step verified no pidfile, no
generation file and no sleep-3600 worker existed on boot 1 (step 24,
LABBOOT_OFF).)

